+    // "float modulation" node values (index z * modnx + x) on a regular modnx x modnz lattice
+    // spanning "point2 modp0".."modp1" = (x, z) in medium space, bilinear, clamped outside.
+    // m <= 1 keeps the density majorant grid valid.
